OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening and night for most with
OL,7,Flengthy clear spells and a sharp frost
OL,8,Fdeveloping. A few scattered rain,
OL,9,Fsleet and snow showers are possible
OL,10,Falong the Borders coast. Minimum
OL,11,FTemperature -6C.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA cold, dry sunny day for
OL,14,Fmost, but scattered rain, sleet and
OL,15,Fsnow showers towards the Borders
OL,16,Fcoast, perhaps heavy at times. Turning
OL,17,Fdry through the evening. Maximum
OL,18,FTemperature 3C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
