OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCold dry
OL,6,Fstart to Friday. Rain and hill snow
OL,7,Fspread east later. Less cold over the
OL,8,Fweekend with a mix of dry spells, some
OL,9,Fshowers or longer spells of rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
